WEBVTT

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:35.920
<i>When the Myoda Sect joined the True Cross Order,</i>

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:38.990
<i>I thought everything was going to be all right.</i>

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:42.120
<i>But that man...</i>

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.180
High Priest Tatsuma.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:52.280
Do you truly have no intention of joining the Order?

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.380
Mamushi! Don't distract the High Priest!

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.350
I don't, no.

00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:59.310
I might not look it,
but I'm very busy these days.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:01.850
With a very important task.

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:07.460
I couldn't shake the feeling that
the High Priest's behavior was suspicious.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:19.860
<i>That suspicion grew by the day
until it had consumed my entire mind.</i>

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:25.870
<i>It was like a poison coursing throughout my body.</i>

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.220
Hey, Houjou!

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:43.560
You're from that Myoda temple place, right?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.800
Yes, I am.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.430
So that must mean you know Shima pretty well, huh?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.280
Do you know if he has a girlfriend?

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:52.360
I wanted to make lunch for him.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:54.760
How does he like his eggs?

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:56.120
What brand of clothes does he wear?

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:58.010
What would be a good present to give him?

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:59.580
Hey, no cheating!

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:01.950
This again?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.520
Huh? What kind of brand is that?

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:08.990
Why come to me with this?
Just go ask him yourself.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:23.970
Why am I so bad at this?

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.750
Hello, Ms. Houjou.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:45.450
Sorry, did I steal your usual spot?

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:49.160
No, you're fine.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.400
You can't seem to fit in, huh?

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:13.310
You always seem to be by yourself,
both at the cram school and in the academy.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.540
But that's not necessarily a bad thing.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:19.940
I'm not very good at socializing either.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.680
But you shouldn't feel pressured to change yourself.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:32.160
If you force yourself to fit in,
your sense of self will become distorted.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:37.670
Trying to live with that distortion will only make things harder on yourself.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:42.630
That's a very painful thing to put yourself through.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:48.920
Isn't teamwork one of the most crucial skills for an Exorcist?

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.600
Teamwork, huh?

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.960
To quote one of my favorite poems,

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:59.030
"The straight road is full of loneliness."

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:00.170
By Santouka?

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.610
I'm surprised you know him.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:06.800
Don't you think that poem summarizes what it means to be human?

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.240
What do you mean?

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:14.750
I have an idea.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:21.460
Will you do some extra homework for me?

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:27.100
It might help you figure out your problem.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.150
How is this homework?

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.320
He's just making me do grunt work.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:50.990
Besides...

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:54.500
Why are you here, monkey?

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.660
I should be asking you that.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:01.820
I knew somebody else was gonna be helping me with this,

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.380
but why's it gotta be you?

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:08.330
Why do I have to look at your dumb face even on the weekend?

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:10.140
Again, that's what I want to ask.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:14.170
Professor Toudou lent me a book the other day,

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:17.070
and I offered to help with
something to return the favor.

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.930
So yesterday he asked me to come and do this.

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:22.770
Why are you here?

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.600
This is the worst.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:29.530
It's too late to complain now.
You'll just have to live with it.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.140
Your face is even more annoying when you're frowning.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.160
What was that!?

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.420
All right, that's enough arguing.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:46.920
I don't want this to take all night.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:55.110
We can carry the bariyons back in our bags by putting talismans on them later,

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:57.390
but for now let's just pile them over there.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:01.760
I'll search around here. You take the other side.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.150
What makes you think you can order me around?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:16.490
I'll look over here. A monkey like you would be better off over there where it's easier to see.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:17.720
Well, go on.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:20.330
You don't have a cute bone in your body, do you?

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:25.090
Mind your own business.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:49.690
Here.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:52.410
What are you doing?

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.490
Giving you a drink.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:57.240
Leave me alone.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.500
Don't get the wrong idea.
I didn't get this for you.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:05.110
Professor Toudou told me
someone else would be here,

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:08.090
so I brought two of these things.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.150
I have my own as well.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:11.870
How much was it?

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:14.390
What? You don't need to pay me back.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.760
I'm not taking any handouts from a monkey.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:22.190
You really don't have a cute bone in your body.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.640
Do you have any friends at the academy?

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.760
You're always by yourself.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:45.960
So what? Why do you care?

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.580
I was asked to look after you.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:53.360
By whom exactly? My father?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.380
No, the High Priest.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:59.260
He was worried about you.

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:04.720
She's easily misunderstood,
but she's a good girl at heart.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:08.300
So make sure you look after her, got it?

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:09.770
Sure.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:13.030
If you say so, High Priest.

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:16.870
That's about how it went.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.240
Well, let's get back to it.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:39.470
Why didn't you join the True Cross Order,
High Priest Tatsuma?

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.040
If you truly care for the Myoda Sect...

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.310
If you wish to protect it...

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:50.730
Shouldn't you take the initiative and become
an Exorcist so you can continue to lead everyone?

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:55.190
Instead, you disappear every day without saying anything.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:59.120
You've even stopped giving sermons!

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.370
What are you trying to do?

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:05.310
Is Myoda that unimportant to you?

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.180
I think we've got enough.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:22.050
If we don't get back soon,
Professor Toudou will start to worry.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:26.520
But you found way more than me.

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.350
What?

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.400
I'm not done yet.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.690
Quit being so stubborn!

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.860
Demons get stronger after the sun sets.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.600
Even bariyons can be dangerous if you underestimate them.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:38.840
I know that!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:40.660
Hey!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.080
There's one!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.130
This is bad!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.720
Get away from that thing!

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:06.520
Mamushi!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:10.390
Oh no!

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:11.470
K'rik!

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:25.240
What were you thinking!?

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.280
That one was obviously matured and more powerful!

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:29.500
You could have gotten your head cracked open!

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.460
Sheesh.

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:38.990
Whatever. I'm glad you're okay.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:42.070
I don't remember asking for your help!

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:46.800
Stop being such a meddling monkey and mind your own business!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.980
<i>I'm awful.</i>

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.190
Come on, let's head back.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:07.030
What's wrong?

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:10.030
It's nothing.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:16.810
Mamushi!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.630
Are you hurt?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.080
I just told you it's nothing.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:25.390
Why are you so...

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:35.680
What are you doing?

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:36.900
Get on.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:40.670
Wh-Why would I let a monkey like you—

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:42.550
This isn't the time for that!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:45.420
Hurry up.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:51.310
If you carry me, we can't bring the bariyons back with us.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:54.790
I'll catch up once the pain goes away,
so leave without me.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:55.790
Are you stupid?

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:58.250
They're just bariyons!

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:00.660
A person in pain is obviously more important!

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:05.380
If I was the one who got hurt, would you leave me behind for some stupid bariyons?

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:10.910
We can always come back for them later.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:13.610
You're way too hardheaded.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.980
Hurry up and get on, dummy.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.920
Seven!

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.380
Eight!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:36.670
Nine!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:37.900
Ten!

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.990
I'll catch you, filthy monkeys!

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:42.210
Uh-oh, here she comes! Run!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:45.510
Mamushi!

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:47.620
Stay away from this place!

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.140
Oh, dear.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:53.520
So this is where you've been, Mamushi.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:56.020
Your father has been worried sick.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.020
Are you ready to come home?

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:04.740
You've grown a lot, Mamushi!

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:15.480
<i>I didn't have any suspicions
about the High Priest back then.</i>

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:18.170
<i>I thought that as long as we followed him,</i>

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.750
<i>he would lead everyone down the right path.</i>

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.490
<i>I trusted him completely.</i>

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.000
<i>But...</i>

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:30.640
<i>How?</i>

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.600
<i>How did things end up like this?</i>

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.300
You okay? Does it still hurt?

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:44.360
Why won't the High Priest join the Order?

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:48.100
He has more important things to do.
He's told you that before.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:50.450
What could be "more important" than this?

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:56.120
Shouldn't the High Priest be the first one to become an Exorcist,

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.940
so he can lead the rest of Myoda?

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:01.880
Isn't that what a high priest is supposed to do?

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:06.900
Have you been worrying
about that this whole time?

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:08.900
This is the first time I've said it out loud.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:12.640
I'm sure High Priest has his reasons.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.160
All we can do is trust his judgment.

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:17.590
Trust him?

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:19.290
Of course.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.350
He's our High Priest.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.110
We have to believe in him.

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:35.620
O-Oh my. Wh-What happened to your leg?

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.180
Well...

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:41.720
We just went to the infirmary,
and they told us it's a sprain.

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:45.240
I'm sorry about the bariyons.
I'll go back for them tomorrow.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:53.840
Never mind that. I'm just glad your injury isn't serious, Ms. Houjou.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.780
Yes, me too.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:03.760
I'd like to have a private discussion with
Ms. Houjou, so could I ask you to step out?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.050
Yes, of course.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.650
Call me if anything happens.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:18.080
He reminds me of many people I know.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:23.420
Not because of his personality or appearance,

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:25.990
but because he has no self-doubt.

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:29.530
He approaches any task with
a strong will and complete focus.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:35.670
I'm sure many people respect and admire him,
and he will no doubt become a fine Exorcist.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.890
<i>And by comparison, I'm...</i>

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:43.600
But you are a different person.

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:47.670
There's no need to try to become like someone else.

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:51.790
What's important is to be wary of your surroundings.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:56.160
And you are very capable of that.

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:16.840
<i>She's wonderfully easy to manipulate.</i>

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:24.350
Now, which one should I use?

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:33.200
But of course, it has to be you!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.370
Oh, humans.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:40.800
The more desperately we want to trust someone,
the more that feeling drags us down,

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:44.520
until we become consumed by our own suspicions.

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:49.880
You're especially vulnerable to that.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:59.220
I'll put you to good use,

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.330
Ms. Mamushi Houjou.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.420
I ask that you keep this between us,

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.450
but do you know of something called the Left Eye of the Impure King?

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.830
Left Eye?

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:15.910
S-Such a thing really exists?

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:21.710
The truth is, I have had my suspicions about Mephisto's behavior for a long time now,

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:27.270
and I believe the High Priest of the Myoda Sect, Tatsuma Suguro, may also be conspiring with him.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.340
It can't be...

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.660
The High Priest?

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:34.620
Won't you help me out, Ms. Houjou?

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:41.620
<i>This is all to protect my home, the Myoda Sect.</i>

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:02.070
<i>I'm sure everyone will understand some day.</i>

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:40.260
So there you have it.

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:42.010
I've decided to marry Mamushi!

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.410
H-How dare you speak for me!

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:48.640
I haven't agreed to anything!

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:52.560
What do you mean? Isn't this only natural after what happened yesterday?

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:56.190
That's enough!
D-Don't speak about that so casually!

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.810
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:03.240
You accursed monkey!
What have you done to our sister?

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:07.450
Juuzou! You're gonna betray us for this skinny snake chick!?

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:11.700
You were supposed to find a blonde babe with a killer body to marry!

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.860
What did you say, you horny Shima monkey!?

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:15.450
You can't mock our sister like that!

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:16.620
Who are you callin' a horny monkey?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.480
What's going on here?

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:22.340
Wow, that's great!

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:24.280
Your brother's getting married!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.430
Aren't you psyched?

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.090
But they're practically related. It creeps me out.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.460
Love isn't dictated by logic or reason.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:35.360
Izumi, I didn't know you were an expert on love!

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.060
Shut up!

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:44.330
I wonder who their kid will take after.
I can't wait to see!

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:46.580
Me neither!

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.320
I'm sure they'll have a cute baby!

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.620
Why are we already talking about their kid?

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.790
Stop! I didn't want to imagine that!

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:57.550
Imagine a kid with Juuzou's eyes and Mamushi's nose.

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:59.290
Now that I'd love to see.

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:04.800
<i>I'm not feeling any sympathy.</i>

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:08.640
Did their parents really agree to it that easily?

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.430
Wait, why would they say no?

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:12.930
Well...

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:16.890
Silence!

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:22.570
J-Juuzou...

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.030
Mamushi doesn't seem to be in agreement with you.

00:22:28.730 --> 00:22:31.350
Indeed! Our sister is way too good for you!

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:33.870
Mamushi.

00:22:34.940 --> 00:22:38.120
I'm serious about marrying you.
Won't you reconsider?

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:44.090
I'm going to be punished.
I wouldn't be permitted to marry.

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:46.150
That's no problem at all!

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:48.990
Just think of marrying me as your punishment!

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:50.980
Then everything will work out fine.

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:54.600
What kind of fool do you take me for!?

00:22:55.430 --> 00:22:58.560
I-I wouldn't...

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:00.310
consider that to be punishment.

00:23:00.620 --> 00:23:02.530
Sister!

00:23:05.260 --> 00:23:07.590
I ask you formally, Uwabami...

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:10.490
Give me your blessing to marry Mamushi!

00:23:14.150 --> 00:23:16.280
Please take good care of my little girl!

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:17.610
That was fast!

00:23:17.610 --> 00:23:19.000
Thank you very much!

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:20.930
Wait, I still haven't accepted...

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:24.660
That's great!

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:26.240
A fitting end.

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:28.910
You guys are killing me here!

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:30.660
I give up.

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:34.400
I'm glad they got a happy ending.

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:35.640
Right, Suguro?

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:38.890
Whatever you say, Lord Satan.

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:42.520
Wh-When did I become Satan himself?

